{"id":"00285","root":"uni00285_1","name":{"ja":"フェリシア","en":"Felicia"},"title":{"ja":"【真祖の血脈】","en":"【True Ancestor Bloodline】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【真祖の血脈】 フェリシア","en":"【True Ancestor Bloodline】 Felicia"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Undead"],"release":"2020-01-15","limited":false,"characterId":35,"profile":{"ja":"その身に狂気を宿した闇の姫。忌まわしき魔道実験の末に生まれた“真祖”の血を引く少女吸血鬼。血統上の“父”は絶大なる魔力を持つ吸血鬼の王・エドウィン・ブラック。その高貴なる血を受け継いだフェリシアは幼い外見ながら高位魔族を凌ぐほどの魔力を持つ。生まれながらにして底知れない狂気を抱き、“父”の寵愛を邪魔する者達――自分を産み落とした母や姉妹を全て虐殺した。そんな異常な性向を好まれてブラックの庇護下に入る。とは言えブラックの配下として活動することは少なく、普段は自由気ままに魔界と人間の世界を行き来して殺戮や暴力を愉しんでいる。吸血鬼の血を由来とする高い再生能力と魔力を持ち、触れたものを全て腐らせる“影の刃”を召喚して使役する。","en":"Felicia is a dark princess who harbors madness within her. Born from a horrific magical experiment, she is a \"true ancestor\" vampire girl whose bloodline's \"father\" is the immensely powerful vampire king Edwin Black. Inheriting his noble blood, Felicia possesses magical power that surpasses even high-rank demons despite her youthful appearance. From birth she has carried an unfathomable insanity, slaughtering everyone who stood in the way of her father's affection—including the mother who bore her and her sisters. Her abnormal tendencies have earned her the protection of Black. Though she rarely acts as Black's subordinate, she freely traverses the Demon Realm and the Human Realm, reveling in carnage and violence. She boasts a high regenerative ability and magical power derived from her vampiric blood, and can summon and command a \"shadow blade\" that rots anything it touches."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"木多野あり","forms":[{"id":"uni00285_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1404,2808],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[183,366],"def":[91,182],"spd":[71,71],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","450004"]},{"id":"uni00285_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2208,4416],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[291,582],"def":[107,214],"spd":[71,71],"luck":[1,100]}